\section{Positions}{


\code{position} is 1-based, unlike \code{\link{readers_read_occupancy}}, whose N-terminus is 0. A peptide shared
by several proteins counts in full for each; MetaMorpheus gives it a proportional share per
protein group, so its \code{IntensityOccupancy_} can differ.

}
